{"type":"FeatureCollection","features":[{"id":"cbf6875974554a74823232f84f563253","type":"Feature","geometry":null,"properties":{"snippet":"With selected residential energy site consumption, expenditures, and household characteristics from the 2020 RECS","extent":null,"commentsEnabled":false,"groupDesignations":null,"access":"public","apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"typeKeywords":["EXB Experience","JavaScript","lastEditor:Kenny.Lohr_eia","modified: 1782828180885","publishVersion:1.12.0","Ready To Use","status: Published","template:blankfullscreen","version:1.21.0","Web Application","Web Experience","Web Mapping Application","Web Page","Web Site"],"description":"<p>We periodically conduct the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential' rel='nofollow ugc'><i>Residential Energy Consumption Survey (RECS)</i></a>, which provides detailed estimates of energy usage in U.S. homes. This dashboard includes selected residential energy site consumption, expenditures, and household characteristics information from the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/' rel='nofollow ugc'><i>2020 RECS</i></a>, the 15<sup>th</sup> iteration of the survey.</p>\n<p>You can find additional information about the <i>2020 RECS</i>, including <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/terminology.cfm' rel='nofollow ugc'>terminology</a>, <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=methodology' rel='nofollow ugc'>methodology</a>,\n<a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=microdata' rel='nofollow ugc'>microdata\nfile</a><span>,</span> and <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=state' rel='nofollow ugc'>data\ntables</a>, on our website.</p>\n<p>Estimates and relative standard error values are available in the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=state#hc' rel='nofollow ugc'>state data tables</a>. Perceived differences between the estimates displayed in the bar chart may not be statistically significant.</p>\n<p>Notes: Some estimates are not available for all states (<i>Data withheld</i>) because either the relative\nstandard error (RSE) was greater than 50% or there were fewer than 10 households in the reporting sample. These are identified as “Q” or “N” in the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=state#hc' rel='nofollow ugc'><i>RECS</i>\ndata tables</a>. Exercise caution when deriving withheld estimates from published estimates.</p>\n<p>Data source: U.S. Energy Information Administration, Office of Energy Demand and Integrated Statistics, <i>2020\nResidential Energy Consumption Survey</i></p>","licenseInfo":null,"ownerId":"2e5318e3f3424840a5a1071512c304a7","title":"Residential Energy Consumption Survey Dashboard","type":"Web Experience","orgId":"FGr1D95XCGALKXqM","screenshots":[],"subInfo":0,"advancedSettings":null,"appCategories":[],"modified":1782828800000,"avgRating":0,"id":"cbf6875974554a74823232f84f563253","categories":[],"spatialReference":null,"numRatings":0,"owner":"EIA.gov","accessInformation":"U.S. Energy Information Administration","largeThumbnail":null,"lastViewed":1787230800000,"thumbnail":"thumbnail/Residential_Energy_Consumption_Survey_Dashboard.png","languages":[],"created":1683647921000,"documentation":null,"banner":null,"classification":null,"url":"https://experience.arcgis.com/experience/cbf6875974554a74823232f84f563253","tags":[],"numViews":76264,"numComments":0,"size":67834,"listed":false,"scoreCompleteness":66,"culture":"en-us","industries":[],"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"name":null,"guid":null,"proxyFilter":null,"properties":null,"source":"U.S. Energy Information Administration","license":"none"},"time":null,"links":[{"rel":"self","type":"application/geo+json","title":"This document as GeoJSON","href":"https://atlas.eia.gov/api/search/v1/collections/all/items/cbf6875974554a74823232f84f563253"},{"rel":"collection","type":"application/json","title":"All","href":"https://atlas.eia.gov/api/search/v1/collections/all"}]},{"id":"ac6b8a0cf7b14d9882877984364fb112","type":"Feature","geometry":null,"properties":{"snippet":"Map of individual tight oil and shale gas plays in the U.S.","extent":null,"commentsEnabled":false,"groupDesignations":null,"access":"public","apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"typeKeywords":["configurableApp","JavaScript","Map","Mapping Site","Online Map","Ready To Use","Web Map"],"description":"<span style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'>Map of individual tight oil and shale gas plays in the U.S.</span>","licenseInfo":"<div style='text-align:center;'><b>Public domain and use of EIA content</b></div><div>U.S. government publications are in the public domain and are not subject to copyright protection. You may use and/or distribute any of our data, files, databases, reports, graphs, charts, and other information products that are on our website or that you receive through our email distribution service. However, if you use or reproduce any of our information products, you should use an acknowledgment, which includes the publication date, such as: &quot;Source: U.S. Energy Information Administration (Oct 2008).&quot;  </div><div style='text-align:center;'><a href='https://www.eia.gov/about/copyrights_reuse.php' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>https://www.eia.gov/about/copyrights_reuse.php </a></div><div><br /></div>","ownerId":"2e5318e3f3424840a5a1071512c304a7","title":"Tight Oil and Shale Gas Plays","type":"Web Mapping Application","orgId":"FGr1D95XCGALKXqM","screenshots":[],"subInfo":0,"advancedSettings":null,"appCategories":[],"modified":1776353510000,"avgRating":0,"id":"ac6b8a0cf7b14d9882877984364fb112","categories":["/Categories/Public Content","/Categories/Oil and Gas Plays"],"spatialReference":"","numRatings":0,"owner":"EIA.gov","accessInformation":"","largeThumbnail":null,"lastViewed":1787227200000,"thumbnail":"thumbnail/thumbnail1604071091490.jpeg","languages":[],"created":1602261228000,"documentation":null,"banner":null,"classification":null,"url":"https://eia.maps.arcgis.com/apps/instant/interactivelegend/index.html?appid=ac6b8a0cf7b14d9882877984364fb112","tags":["Page - Energy Maps"],"numViews":35567,"numComments":0,"size":3721,"listed":false,"scoreCompleteness":76,"culture":"en-us","industries":[],"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"name":null,"guid":null,"proxyFilter":null,"properties":null,"source":"U.S. Energy Information Administration","license":"custom"},"time":null,"links":[{"rel":"self","type":"application/geo+json","title":"This document as GeoJSON","href":"https://atlas.eia.gov/api/search/v1/collections/all/items/ac6b8a0cf7b14d9882877984364fb112"},{"rel":"collection","type":"application/json","title":"All","href":"https://atlas.eia.gov/api/search/v1/collections/all"}]},{"id":"f2f95edeb04d48f58ee267f035682103","type":"Feature","geometry":null,"properties":{"snippet":"With selected residential energy site consumption, expenditures, and household characteristics from the 2020 RECS","extent":null,"commentsEnabled":false,"groupDesignations":null,"access":"public","apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"typeKeywords":["Data","Document"],"description":"<p>We periodically conduct the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential' rel='nofollow ugc'><i>Residential Energy Consumption Survey (RECS)</i></a>, which provides detailed estimates of energy usage in U.S. homes. This dashboard includes selected residential energy site consumption, expenditures, and household characteristics information from the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/' rel='nofollow ugc'><i>2020 RECS</i></a>, the 15<sup>th</sup> iteration of the survey.</p><p>You can find additional information about the <i>2020 RECS</i>, including <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/terminology.cfm' rel='nofollow ugc'>terminology</a>, <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=methodology' rel='nofollow ugc'>methodology</a>, <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=microdata' rel='nofollow ugc'>microdata file</a>, and <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=state' rel='nofollow ugc'>data tables</a>, on our website.</p><p>Estimates and relative standard error values are available in the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=state#hc' rel='nofollow ugc'>state data tables</a>. Perceived differences between the estimates displayed in the bar chart may not be statistically significant.</p><p>Notes: Some estimates are not available for all states (<i>Data withheld</i>) because either the relative standard error (RSE) was greater than 50% or there were fewer than 10 households in the reporting sample. These are identified as “Q” or “N” in the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=state#hc' rel='nofollow ugc'><i>RECS</i> data tables</a>. Exercise caution when deriving withheld estimates from published estimates.</p><p>Data source: U.S. Energy Information Administration, Office of Energy Demand and Integrated Statistics, <i>2020 Residential Energy Consumption Survey</i></p>","licenseInfo":null,"ownerId":"2e5318e3f3424840a5a1071512c304a7","title":"Residential Energy Consumption Survey Dashboard","type":"Document Link","orgId":"FGr1D95XCGALKXqM","screenshots":[],"subInfo":0,"advancedSettings":null,"appCategories":[],"modified":1692050583000,"avgRating":0,"id":"f2f95edeb04d48f58ee267f035682103","categories":[],"spatialReference":null,"numRatings":0,"owner":"EIA.gov","accessInformation":null,"largeThumbnail":null,"lastViewed":1786622400000,"thumbnail":"thumbnail/thumbnail1692050506631.png","languages":[],"created":1692050476000,"documentation":null,"banner":null,"cla